Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:50:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 128/149] MnK keyboard text entry for name boxes (GitHub #53):
 answer the type-2 keyboard capability for flags=2, map VK + Unicode
 keystrokes, suppress A-Z/0-9 pad binds while the title polls keystrokes

Opt-in with WWE2K14_KEYBOARD_TEXT=1 (the launcher sets it with mnk mode). Verified in game 2026-10-26 (lane kbd2,
CAW NAME field TEST1 / Backspace / Enter). Owner approved for the public release 2026-10-26.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
